From cafa59384e6c5680343b583885ed5b4b712aa163 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leonid Zaburunov <zaburunov.lv@aobfg.ru>
Date: Sun, 27 Jul 2025 11:23:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/50] meson: Introduce option for enable/disable tests

