Subject: [PATCH 11/50] Update mock-pkcs11 for PKCS11 3.1

This integrates changes from:
https://github.com/Pkcs11Interop/pkcs11-mock/commit/cc53a873b6cf63958283fa138dc4bd776cbc7580

Notably, this works around a confusing OpenSC bug that causes
mock-pkcs11 to not load if pkcs11-spy is installed:
https://github.com/OpenSC/OpenSC/issues/3580

I've also snuck in an unrelated and unnecessary fix for:
https://github.com/Pkcs11Interop/pkcs11-mock/pull/7

Instead of using upstream PKCS11 headers, I dodge licensing problems by
taking pkcs11.h from the latchset project:

  https://github.com/latchset/pkcs11-headers/tree/main/public-domain

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib-networking/-/merge_requests/268>
